---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Evidence-First Peptide Research Library"
  description="PeptiBloom is a public peptide research library and calculation toolkit built around evidence, transparent uncertainty and traceable sources."
>
  <section class="section home-hero">
    <div class="site-frame home-hero__grid">
      <div class="home-hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Scientific Research Library</p>
        <h1>Know what we know.<br /><em>Know what we don’t.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero__lead">PeptiBloom is building a public scientific research library designed to make evidence, uncertainty, provenance and open questions easier to inspect.</p>
        <div class="hero__actions">
          <a class="button button--primary" href="/library/">Explore the library</a>
          <a class="button button--ghost" href="/research-basics/">Start with Research Basics</a>
        </div>
        <div class="home-hero__trust" aria-label="Editorial principles">
          <span><strong>Evidence</strong><small>without overstatement</small></span>
          <span><strong>Independent</strong><small>science before hype</small></span>
          <span><strong>Traceable</strong><small>a route back to sources</small></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="home-hero__visual">
        <img src="/brand/editorial/visuals/pb-home-bloom-molecule-v1.svg" alt="Abstract lavender flower and molecular structure representing PeptiBloom's editorial science identity" />
        <figcaption><span>Evidence first.</span><strong>Science can be beautiful without becoming marketing.</strong></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--quiet" aria-labelledby="explore-title">
    <div class="site-frame">
      <div class="home-section-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Start here</p><h2 id="explore-title">Three ways to explore PeptiBloom.</h2></div>
        <p>Move from scientific literacy to the library itself without confusing education, evidence and commercial information.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="explore-grid">
        <a class="explore-card" href="/library/">
          <img src="/brand/editorial/visuals/pb-library-dossier-v1.svg" alt="Editorial illustration of scientific books and a molecular structure" />
          <div><p class="surface-kicker">Scientific Library</p><h3>Follow evidence, limits and provenance.</h3><span>Browse the library →</span></div>
        </a>
        <a class="explore-card" href="/research-basics/">
          <img src="/brand/editorial/visuals/pb-coa-document-v1.svg" alt="Editorial illustration of a laboratory certificate and vial" />
          <div><p class="surface-kicker">Research Basics</p><h3>Understand the documents, methods and concepts around research.</h3><span>Start learning →</span></div>
        </a>
        <a class="explore-card explore-card--statement" href="/about/">
          <div class="statement-mark" aria-hidden="true">PB</div>
          <div><p class="surface-kicker">About PeptiBloom</p><h3>A library before a catalogue.</h3><p>Scientific information remains structurally distinguishable from commercial information.</p><span>Why PeptiBloom exists →</span></div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
    <div class="site-frame editorial-band">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Editorial standard</p><h2 id="principles-title">Evidence belongs beside its limits.</h2></div>
      <div class="editorial-band__grid">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>What the evidence supports</h3><p>Supported findings should be understandable in context and traceable to their sources.</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h3>What remains uncertain</h3><p>Missing evidence, disagreement and unanswered questions remain visible rather than being normalised into certainty.</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h3>How we got there</h3><p>Provenance, review boundaries and interpretation stay inspectable.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft" aria-labelledby="tool-title">
    <div class="site-frame tool-modern">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Open research tool</p><h2 id="tool-title">Transparent arithmetic, visible boundaries.</h2><p class="section-lead">The free calculator converts stated vial content, final solution volume, mass units and syringe-scale positions. It shows every step and never supplies a dose or regimen.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/calculator/">Open the calculator</a></div>
      <aside><p class="surface-kicker">Arithmetic ≠ recommendation</p><div class="unit-cloud"><span>mg/mL</span><span>µg/mL</span><span>mL</span><span>U-100</span></div><p>The tool cannot determine safety, suitability, purity, sterility or an appropriate amount for any compound or person.</p></aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.home-hero{padding-top:clamp(2rem,5vw,5rem)}.home-hero__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.92fr) minmax(0,1.08fr);gap:clamp(2rem,6vw,5rem);align-items:center}.home-hero__copy h1{font-size:clamp(3.4rem,7vw,6.8rem);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.045em;max-width:9.2ch;margin:.35rem 0 1.5rem}.home-hero__copy h1 em{color:var(--color-mulberry);font-weight:400}.button--ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline);color:var(--color-mulberry)}.home-hero__visual{position:relative;margin:0}.home-hero__visual img{display:block;width:100%;border-radius:2rem;box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(83,61,93,.14)}.home-hero__visual figcaption{position:absolute;right:1.3rem;bottom:1.3rem;max-width:15rem;padding:1rem 1.1rem;border-radius:1rem;background:rgba(36,29,37,.78);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);color:white}.home-hero__visual figcaption span,.home-hero__visual figcaption strong{display:block}.home-hero__visual figcaption span{font:600 .72rem/1.2 var(--font-system);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;opacity:.7}.home-hero__visual figcaption strong{margin-top:.35rem;font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.2}.home-hero__trust{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem;margin-top:2rem;padding-top:1.35rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-hairline)}.home-hero__trust span{display:grid;gap:.15rem}.home-hero__trust strong{font:600 .82rem var(--font-system);color:var(--color-ink)}.home-hero__trust small{color:var(--color-muted-ink)}.home-section-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(16rem,.55fr);gap:2rem;align-items:end;margin-bottom:2rem}.home-section-heading h2{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5vw,4.4rem);line-height:.98}.home-section-heading>p{margin:0;color:var(--color-muted-ink)}.explore-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.2rem}.explore-card{overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline);border-radius:1.4rem;background:var(--color-paper);box-shadow:var(--shadow-paper);color:var(--color-ink);text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease}.explore-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 20px 44px rgba(83,61,93,.11);color:var(--color-ink)}.explore-card img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/8;object-fit:cover;display:block}.explore-card>div{padding:1.25rem}.explore-card h3{margin:.35rem 0 .8rem;font-size:1.55rem;line-height:1.08}.explore-card span{color:var(--color-mulberry);font:600 .9rem var(--font-system)}.explore-card--statement{display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto 1fr;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#F7F2F7,#EEE8F6)}.statement-mark{min-height:12rem;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:5rem;color:rgba(122,63,104,.18);background:radial-gradient(circle at 65% 35%,rgba(200,111,154,.22),transparent 38%),radial-gradient(circle at 30% 65%,rgba(139,123,184,.26),transparent 42%)}.editorial-band{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.62fr) minmax(0,1.38fr);gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,6rem);align-items:start}.editorial-band h2{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem);line-height:.98;margin:.4rem 0}.editorial-band__grid{display:grid;gap:0}.editorial-band__grid article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr;column-gap:1rem;padding:1.25rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-hairline)}.editorial-band__grid span{grid-row:1/3;color:var(--color-lavender-deep);font:600 .8rem var(--font-system)}.editorial-band__grid h3,.editorial-band__grid p{margin:0}.editorial-band__grid p{margin-top:.35rem;color:var(--color-muted-ink)}.tool-modern{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(19rem,.72fr);gap:clamp(2rem,6vw,5rem);align-items:center}.tool-modern aside{padding:2rem;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline);border-radius:1.4rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.72)}.unit-cloud{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.55rem;margin:1rem 0}.unit-cloud span{padding:.55rem .7rem;border-radius:999px;background:var(--color-paper);border:1px solid var(--color-hairline);font:600 .85rem var(--font-system);color:var(--color-lavender-deep)}@media(max-width:900px){.home-hero__grid,.editorial-band,.tool-modern{grid-template-columns:1fr}.explore-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.home-hero__copy h1{max-width:11ch}.home-section-heading{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:640px){.explore-grid,.home-hero__trust{grid-template-columns:1fr}.home-hero__visual figcaption{position:static;margin-top:.8rem;background:var(--color-ink)}.home-hero__copy h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,16vw,4.8rem)}}
</style>
